Hello!

Do you spend a lot of time involved in "virtual" activies such as USENET,
IRC, MUDs, or some other computer enviornment that involves groups of
people interacting with one another (whether role-playing or not)?

Do you spend too much time doing these things?  Did you ever spend too
much time doing these things?  I'm interested in hearing from you if
any of the above questions apply.  I leave the definition of "too much time"
up to you... I'm preparing a paper on Virtual Reality Addictions and I
very much request your input.  

Please complete any parts of the following questionaire that you'd like to
and e-mail it to me at
			chudel@watarts.uwaterloo.ca

Of course I've no intention of using personal real identities in the paper
so please be as detailed as possible.  I personally guarantee confidentiality
of your information.

Thank you,
